<title>USA: Par Tech says Q1 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Par Tech says Q1 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HARTFORD, N.Y. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended</p>
<p> March 31:				1997		    1996</p>
<p> Revenues			     $18,063		$25,494</p>
<p> Net Income (loss)		  (2,393)		    551</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) Per Share	 (0.26)		   0.07</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding*		  9,130		  8,157</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the shortfall in revenue was due to an unforeseen delay in the delivery of its POS 4 hardware systems to certain customers.  We also experienced a delay in releasing POS 4 and our new &quot;intouch&quot; software to our sales force from December, 1996 to March of this year.</p>
</text>
